# Brother Hai's Pho Restaurant - Environment Variables

# Google Analytics Configuration
# 获取方式: https://analytics.google.com/ → 管理 → 数据流 → 衡量ID
# How to get: https://analytics.google.com/ → Admin → Data Streams → Measurement ID
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Bing Webmaster Tools Verification (Optional)
# 获取方式: https://www.bing.com/webmasters
BING_VERIFICATION_KEY=your-bing-verification-key

# Notes:
# - 复制此文件为 .env.local 并填入真实的值
# - Copy this file as .env.local and fill in your actual values
# - .env.local 不会被提交到 Git (已在 .gitignore 中)
# - .env.local will not be committed to Git (already in .gitignore)
